<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp#Product
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Product> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#QuantitativeValue
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#QuantitativeValue> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#ReferencePeriod
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#ReferencePeriod> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-context#TextileContextFactorConcept
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-context#TextileContextFactorConcept> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                     rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
                                                                     <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-ontology> ;
                                                                     rdfs:comment "A SKOS concept identifying the type of contextual condition observed or declared for a textile product or process execution."@en ;
                                                                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-context> ;
                                                                     rdfs:label "Textile context factor concept"@en ;
                                                                     <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "CIRPASS Textile Ontology modelling specification, version 1.1.0."@en ;
                                                                     <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingAbstraction> .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-context#TextileContextObservation
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-context#TextileContextObservation> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                   <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-ontology> ;
                                                                   rdfs:comment "A concrete observation, declaration or setting of a contextual condition applying to a textile product or a textile process execution."@en ;
                                                                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-context> ;
                                                                   rdfs:label "Textile context observation"@en ;
                                                                   <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "CIRPASS Textile Ontology modelling specification, version 1.1.0."@en ;
                                                                   <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingAbstraction> .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TextileProcessExecution
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TextileProcessExecution> rdf:type owl:Class .


